&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in Python, SQL, and Apache Spark.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building scalable batch and real-time ETL/ELT pipelines.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with AWS services including EMR, S3, Glue, and Athena.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
