&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;All qualified applications will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, nationality, religion, sexual orientation, gender, gender identity, age, physical [dis]ability, or length of time spent unemployed.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We help you capture every opportunity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scandit.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.scandit.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
