&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Helsing builds AI to protect our democracies, and strict security is fundamental to our operations. As an Information Security Officer, you will actively maintain and advance our security posture across compliance, risk management, and security awareness. This cross-functional role requires direct collaboration with engineering, product, legal, and operational teams to solve complex challenges. You will apply your expertise in a technically demanding, highly regulated environment where your work delivers immediate and meaningful impact.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The day-to-day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conduct internal audits and assessments against ISO 27001, BSI IT-Grundschutz, and other applicable frameworks; track findings and drive remediation efforts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prepare and maintain security documentation, policies, and procedures in strict alignment with internal standards and compliance frameworks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Advance our risk management processes by maintaining risk registers, conducting assessments, and executing treatment plans&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Perform thorough security assessments across internal systems to identify control gaps and implement practical improvements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design and execute security awareness initiatives, including targeted training and communications, to establish robust security practices across the organisation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate with engineering, product, legal, and operations teams to seamlessly embed security requirements into daily workflows&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;You’ll-do-great-if-you….3&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;15247&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You should apply if you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrate hands-on experience conducting audits and assessments against ISO 27001 or BSI IT-Grundschutz within structured compliance frameworks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage risk identification, assessment, and treatment processes effectively in a professional environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Communicate complex security requirements clearly and concisely to non-security stakeholders across engineering, product, and operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design and deliver impactful security awareness initiatives that build a cohesive security culture&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exhibit meticulous organisation, with the proven ability to manage documentation, track audit findings, and oversee remediation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Speak and write fluent German to successfully navigate the regulatory environment and manage BSI IT-Grundschutz requirements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Seek to advance your career in a technically complex environment where your work directly supports the protection of democratic values&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
