&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Relevant professional certifications, such as ISO 27001 Lead Auditor or equivalent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience operating within the defence, government, or critical infrastructure sectors&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with additional compliance frameworks beyond ISO 27001 and BSI IT-Grundschutz, including SOC 2 or NIST&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exposure to AI or software development environments, including an understanding of the specific security considerations for developing and deploying machine learning systems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience preparing for external audits and liaising directly with third-party auditors&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
