&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(186, 55, 42); font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Licensed Practical Nurses needed for 1:1 INFANT Home Care&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care is looking for Licensed Practical Nurses (LPNs) who have a passion for infant care to join our Monmouth County Skilled Nursing team. We believe our clients and their families deserve the highest quality care delivered with compassion, excellence, and reliability.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We currently have opportunities caring for&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;infant clients (birth to 1 year old)&lt;/strong&gt; in the &lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Asbury Park&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;, Holmdel, Howell, &lt;/strong&gt;and&lt;strong&gt; Morganville&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;areas. &lt;br&gt;We have&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;additional opportunities caring for &lt;strong&gt;toddlers &lt;/strong&gt;in the &lt;strong&gt;Red Bank&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;West Long Branch&lt;/strong&gt; areas.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
